  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you take a Magic action to read this scroll, the titan named in it appears in an unoccupied space on the ground or in water that you can see within 1 mile of you. The DM picks a suitable titan or rolls on the table below (see the Monster Manual for its stat block).</p><table><thead><tr><th>1d100</th><th>Titan</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>01–15</td><td>Animal Lord</td></tr><tr><td>16–30</td><td>Blob of Annihilation</td></tr><tr><td>31–45</td><td>Colossus</td></tr><tr><td>46–60</td><td>Elemental Cataclysm</td></tr><tr><td>61–75</td><td>Empyrean</td></tr><tr><td>76–90</td><td>Kraken (it requires a body of water large enough to hold it, or the summoning fails and the scroll is wasted)</td></tr><tr><td>91–00</td><td>Tarrasque</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The titan is Hostile toward all other creatures and disappears when it drops to 0 Hit Points. If it is summoned into a space too small to contain it, the summoning fails and the scroll is wasted.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
